memory/LLM/01_Daily/*
!memory/LLM/01_Daily/.gitkeep
memory/LLM/02_Projects/
memory/LLM/05_Archive/
memory/LLM/03_Areas/*
!memory/LLM/03_Areas/AI-Workflows/
memory/LLM/03_Areas/AI-Workflows/*
# ...except these two lessons, cleaned of company detail for sharing
!memory/LLM/03_Areas/AI-Workflows/Lessons - Building and Testing the Airtronic Demo.md
!memory/LLM/03_Areas/AI-Workflows/Lessons - Parallel Build With an AI Manager Session.md

# Never commit keys or secrets
.env
.env.*
.secrets/
*.key
*key*.txt
*.pfx
*.pem
